cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark pack, please cite it as below."
title: "Certified benchmark pack for linear elasticity"
version: "0.1"
date-released: "2026-11-25"
authors:
  - name: "SimulationStation"
repository-code: "https://github.com/simulationstation/CertiField/tree/main/benchpack"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Verification problems in linear elasticity (a plate with a circular hole, an L-bracket, a cube with a spherical
  cavity) whose stiffness and local stress averages come with guaranteed two-sided intervals, computed with exact
  curved geometry and outward-rounded arithmetic and re-checked by an independent program; with a harness that
  runs finite-element codes against the intervals. Data are licensed CC BY 4.0.
keywords:
  - verification
  - finite element method
  - linear elasticity
  - complementary energy
  - interval arithmetic
